                        </div>
                      </div>
                      <div class="typography-single-block">
                        <div class="typography-text-block">
                          <h6>Heading 6</h6>
                        </div>
                        <div class="typography-info-block">
                          <div class="paragraph-xsmall text-weight-medium">General Sans • Medium • 1.25rem • 1.3 Line Height</div>
                        </div>
                      </div>
                      <div class="typography-single-block">
                        <div class="typography-text-block">
                          <p class="text-size-large text-color-white">Paragraph Large: The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog. Designers use this text as a placeholder.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="typography-info-block">
                          <div class="paragraph-xsmall text-weight-medium">Geist • Light • 1.125rem • 1.5 Line Height</div>
                        </div>
                      </div>
                      <div class="typography-single-block">
                        <div class="typography-text-block">
                          <p class="text-size-regular text-color-white">Paragraph Regular: The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog. Designers use this text as a placeholder.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="typography-info-block">
                          <div class="paragraph-xsmall text-weight-medium">Geist • Light • 1rem • 1.5 Line Height</div>
                        </div>
                      </div>
                      <div class="typography-single-block">
                        <div class="typography-text-block">
                          <p class="text-size-small text-color-white">Paragraph Small: The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog. Designers use this text as a placeholder.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="typography-info-block">
                          <div class="paragraph-xsmall text-weight-medium">Geist • Light • 0.875rem • 1.5 Line Height</div>
                        </div>
                      </div>
                      <div class="typography-single-block">
                        <div class="typography-text-block">
                          <p class="text-size-xsmall text-color-white">Paragraph Xsmall: The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog. Designers use this text as a placeholder.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="typography-info-block">
                          <div class="paragraph-xsmall text-weight-medium">Geist • Light • 0.75rem • 1.5 Line Height</div>
                        </div>
                      </div>
                    </div>
